<div id="sbs-mq" class="sbs-mq">
 <div class="sbs-tool-row"><button id="sbs-mq-produce" class="sbs-button">Reviewed pair queue</button><button id="sbs-mq-manage" class="sbs-button">Manage Templates</button><button id="sbs-mq-single" class="sbs-button">Single-image Mock-ups</button></div>
 <p id="sbs-mq-status" class="sbs-result" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose single-image mode or a reusable model / flat-lay pair.</p>
 <div id="sbs-mq-production" hidden>
  <div class="sbs-tool-row"><label>Collection<select id="sbs-mq-group"><option value="men">Men</option><option value="women">Women</option></select></label><label>Export preset<select id="sbs-mq-preset"><option>Pinterest</option><option>Original</option><option>Square</option></select></label><button id="sbs-mq-refresh" class="sbs-button">Refresh catalogue and templates</button></div>
  <h2>1. Choose model template</h2><div id="sbs-mq-model" class="sbs-mq-grid"></div><h2>2. Choose flat lay</h2><div id="sbs-mq-flat" class="sbs-mq-grid"></div>
  <h2>3. Choose approved designs</h2><label>Search title, series or catalogue ID<input id="sbs-mq-search" type="search"></label><div id="sbs-mq-artwork" class="sbs-mq-artwork"></div><p id="sbs-mq-count" role="status"></p><button id="sbs-mq-start" class="sbs-button primary">Start Queue</button>
  <div id="sbs-mq-review" hidden><h2 id="sbs-mq-current"></h2><div class="sbs-tool-row"><button id="sbs-mq-render" class="sbs-button">Render current pair</button><button id="sbs-mq-retry" class="sbs-button">Try Again</button><button id="sbs-mq-pause" class="sbs-button">Stop / Pause Queue</button><button id="sbs-mq-resume" class="sbs-button">Resume Queue</button><button id="sbs-mq-previous" class="sbs-button">Back to previous</button></div><div id="sbs-mq-outputs"></div><p>Downloads are optional and never approve or advance the queue. If Android blocks multiple downloads, use the two individual file buttons.</p><div class="sbs-tool-row"><button id="sbs-mq-download" class="sbs-button">Download Pair — two image files</button><button id="sbs-mq-approve" class="sbs-button primary">Approve &amp; Next</button><button id="sbs-mq-reject" class="sbs-button">Reject</button><button id="sbs-mq-skip" class="sbs-button">Skip</button><button id="sbs-mq-drive" class="sbs-button">Retry approved pair Drive filing</button><button id="sbs-mq-discard" class="sbs-button">Finish / Discard Queue</button></div><label>Optional rejection note<input id="sbs-mq-reason" maxlength="300"></label><p id="sbs-mq-summary"></p></div>
 </div>
 <div id="sbs-mq-manager" hidden><button id="sbs-mq-back" class="sbs-button">Back to Mock-ups</button><h2>Template library</h2><div class="sbs-tool-row"><label>Collection<select id="sbs-mq-filter-group"><option value="men">Men</option><option value="women">Women</option></select></label><label>Template type<select id="sbs-mq-filter-kind"><option value="model">Model</option><option value="flat">Flat Lay</option></select></label><label>Search filename<input id="sbs-mq-template-search" type="search"></label></div><p id="sbs-mq-totals"></p><label class="sbs-button">Add / Import Templates<input id="sbs-mq-import" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" multiple></label><button id="sbs-mq-sync" class="sbs-button">Import / reconcile Drive templates</button><p id="sbs-mq-sync-status" role="status"></p><div id="sbs-mq-gallery" class="sbs-mq-grid"></div></div>
 <dialog id="sbs-mq-viewer" class="sbs-mq-dialog" aria-labelledby="sbs-mq-view-title"><h2 id="sbs-mq-view-title"></h2><button id="sbs-mq-close" class="sbs-button">Close / Back</button><div id="sbs-mq-image-view" class="sbs-tool-view"><img id="sbs-mq-image" alt="Complete template or mock-up"></div><div class="sbs-tool-row"><button id="sbs-mq-zoom-in" class="sbs-button">Zoom in</button><button id="sbs-mq-zoom-out" class="sbs-button">Zoom out</button><button id="sbs-mq-fit" class="sbs-button">Fit image</button></div></dialog>
 <dialog id="sbs-mq-delete-dialog" class="sbs-mq-dialog" aria-labelledby="sbs-mq-delete-title"><h2 id="sbs-mq-delete-title">Delete this template from Studio?</h2><img id="sbs-mq-delete-image" alt="Template to delete"><p id="sbs-mq-delete-name"></p><p>Its Google Drive original and completed mock-ups remain unchanged.</p><button id="sbs-mq-delete-cancel" class="sbs-button" autofocus>Cancel</button><button id="sbs-mq-delete-confirm" class="sbs-button">Delete permanently</button></dialog>
 <dialog id="sbs-mq-calibration" class="sbs-mq-dialog" aria-labelledby="sbs-mq-cal-title"><h2 id="sbs-mq-cal-title">Set reusable shirt area</h2><p>Drag the four gold corners to the safe print area. To recolour, paint only the shirt fabric with Shirt mask; leave skin, sleeves over arms and background unmarked. Empty mask keeps the original shirt colour.</p><div class="sbs-tool-row"><label>Mode<select id="sbs-mq-cal-mode"><option value="corners">Print-area corners</option><option value="paint">Shirt mask — add</option><option value="erase">Shirt mask — erase</option></select></label><label>Brush size<input id="sbs-mq-brush" type="range" min="5" max="180" value="50"></label><label>Shirt colour<input id="sbs-mq-colour" type="color" value="#ffffff"></label><label><input id="sbs-mq-lighting" type="checkbox" checked>Follow fabric lighting</label></div><div class="sbs-tool-view"><canvas id="sbs-mq-cal-canvas" width="800" height="800" aria-label="Template print-area and shirt mask editor"></canvas></div><div class="sbs-tool-row"><button id="sbs-mq-cal-undo" class="sbs-button">Undo</button><button id="sbs-mq-cal-save" class="sbs-button primary">Save calibrated template</button><button id="sbs-mq-cal-cancel" class="sbs-button">Cancel</button></div><p id="sbs-mq-cal-status" role="status"></p></dialog>
</div>
